<title>BELGIUM: DE MAERTELAERE OPENS ROESELARE BRANCH.</title>
<headline>DE MAERTELAERE OPENS ROESELARE BRANCH.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank De Maertelaere NV said on Friday it was opening a new branch in the Belgian town of Roeselaere on Monday.</p>
<p>The new office will be the eighth for the Ghent-based bank which specialises in investment consultancy and asset management. It employs 98 people.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
